    "title": "Man Arrested for Drug Possession and Bribery - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chelsea Reber ,\n7 hours ago A College Station man arrested for drug possession is also charged with bribery after telling police officers he would pay them $10,000 if they let him go. According to the Texas A&M Police arrest report, a traffic stop for an expired registration sticker led to a search of the suspect’s truck where officers found marijuana, cocaine, and drug paraphernalia. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
